OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Aof taxi driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 24-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fthe attempted murder of a taxi driver
OL,8,Fin west Belfast in 2025.
OL,10,FSean O'Reilly was shot twice as he sat
OL,11,Finside his car in the Bell Steel Manor
OL,12,Farea on 23 February.
OL,14,FThe man was arrested in the early hours
OL,15,Fof Wednesday and was also charged with
OL,16,Fa number of firearms offences.
OL,18,FHe is expected to appear before Belfast
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
